  _id: 14041216
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_POST_QUEST
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueText: 'Welcome back, traveller.

    The winds have grown gentler since
    the Eastern Altar was freed. For the first time in many years, these crossroads
    feel almost peaceful.

    I cannot say what lies beyond our lands, nor whether
    the First Flame can ever be restored.

    But I believe that wherever your journey
    leads, you will carry its light with you.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: Tell me about the First Flame again
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 237790b69086ede4b8a1ef3d9020febc, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: Tell me about Aurelian.
    _requirements: []
    _actions: []
    _nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41582da0d0721dc49a0b8f8ceae13c87, type: 2}
  - _choiceText: Farewell, Seraphine.
